            "en-US": "The original rate guarantee target cannot be held in outage scenarios; an alternative is proposed: lower the rate guarantee target to 2Mbps or shorten the energy-saving period to 6 hours; please assess and confirm."
          }
        },
        "llm": {
          "script": [
